<title>SINGAPORE: PRESS DIGEST - Singapore - April 8.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Singapore - April 8.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the top stories from selected Singapore newspapers. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE STRAITS TIMES:</p>
<p>- The eldest daughter of Lieutenant-General Tin Oo, one of Burma's top military officials, died when a parcel bomb exploded at their home.</p>
